ch":"5.x","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"This is somewhat related to cakephp/cakephp#9408.\n\nThis code causes a warning to be emitted:\n\n``` php\n$this->response->body(function () use ($writer) {\n    $writer->save('php://output');\n});\n```\n\nThe warning is `strrpos() expects parameter 1 to be string, object given [ROOT/vendor/cakephp/debug_kit/src/Routing/Filter/DebugBarFilter.php, line 232]`\n\nI also get a `RuntimeException` with message `Unable to emit response; headers already sent`, but I'm not completely sure if this is related. The exception goes away, when I disable DebugKit or use non-streamed responses, though.\n\nFor context: I'm trying to sent a streamed resource that is a complete HTML page (PHPExcel's Html Writer).\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/debug_kit/issues/452/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/debug_kit/issues/452/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]